<title>GREECE: TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, JULY 17.</title>
<headline>TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, JULY 17.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Greece's fixing rates</p>
<p>for leading currencies on Thursday were as follows.</p>
<p>------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p> Currency:     July 17     July 16   Dec 31 96    CHANGE</p>
<p>								 FROM YR-END</p>
<p>------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>- USD =	  282.140     281.500     247.020   13.81 %</p>
<p>- ECU =	  309.850     309.920     306.830    0.98 %</p>
<p>- DEM =	  157.095     156.990     158.970   -1.18 %</p>
<p>- FRF =	   46.514	46.474	47.182   -1.42 %</p>
<p>- GBP =	  470.180     472.460     419.180   12.17 %</p>
<p>- NLG =	  139.555     139.435     141.685   -1.50 %</p>
<p>- ITL (100) =   16.170	16.135	16.185   -0.09 %</p>
<p>- JPY (100) =  242.900     243.090     212.430   14.34 %</p>
<p>- ESP =	    1.867	 1.863	 1.888   -1.11 %</p>
<p>- PTE =	    1.557	 1.555	 1.581   -1.52 %</p>
<p>- CHF =	  190.335     190.545     183.135    3.93 %</p>
<p>Note: The percentage net change is calculated as the percentage</p>
<p>difference between the most recent fixing rate and the December</p>
<p>31, 1996 rate.</p>
<p>--Angelos Kiosklis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
